.
.SH NAME
alacrittyforge \- terminal UI for managing Alacritty configuration
.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B alacrittyforge
.
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B alacrittyForge
is a Catppuccin Mocha–themed terminal UI for viewing, editing, and backing up
the Alacritty terminal emulator's TOML configuration. It writes only to your
user-space config at
.IR ~/.config/alacritty/alacritty.toml ,
with timestamped backups in
.IR ~/.config/alacritty/backups/ ;
no root privileges are required.

The application is organized around five screens, switchable from the sidebar
or with the number keys:
.TP
.B 1 — Dashboard
System overview: config status, active theme, font, opacity, backup count.
.TP
.B 2 — Config Editor
Browse and edit all alacritty.toml settings with live validation.
.TP
.B 3 — Themes
Browse, preview, and apply installed Alacritty color themes.
.TP
.B 4 — Fonts
View and edit font family / style / size with a side panel of system fonts.
.TP
.B 5 — Key Bindings
View default + user-defined bindings, add custom bindings, delete user ones.
.
.SH KEYBINDINGS
.SS Global (any screen)
.TP
.B 1 .. 5
Switch to the corresponding screen.
.TP
.B R
Refresh the current screen's view from disk.
.TP
.B ?
Toggle the help overlay (press again, or Esc, q, or ? to close).
.TP
.B q
Quit.
.
.SS Config Editor and Fonts
.TP
.B E
Edit the selected value (focuses the input).
.TP
.B S
Save all pending changes (with confirmation; auto-backs-up first).
.
.SS Themes
.TP
.B A
Apply the selected theme (with confirmation).
.TP
.B F5
Rescan the themes directory.
.TP
.B H
Toggle the theme installation guide.
.
.SS Key Bindings
.TP
.B N
Add a new binding from the input fields.
.TP
.B D
Delete the selected user-defined binding.
.
.SH SAFETY
Every write to
.I alacritty.toml
goes through three layers:
.IP \(bu 2
.B Validation
— input is checked before being staged.
.IP \(bu 2
.B Confirmation
— a modal dialog asks before any disk write (Esc cancels, Enter confirms).
.IP \(bu 2
.B Backup
— a timestamped copy of the current config is written to
.I ~/.config/alacritty/backups/
before every modification. Up to 20 backups are kept (FIFO).
.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/alacritty/alacritty.toml
Alacritty's user configuration file. alacrittyForge reads and writes here.
.TP
.I ~/.config/alacritty/backups/
Timestamped auto-backups created before every write.
.TP
.I ~/.config/alacritty/themes/
Directory scanned for installed color themes.
.
